<title>USA: TABLE - Quintel Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Quintel Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PEARL RIVER, N.Y. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiscal Second Quarter Ended May 31,</p>
<p>					 1997			   1996</p>
<p> Net revenues	     $53,323,734		   $13,765,685</p>
<p> Gross profit		13,786,298		     1,638,439</p>
<p> SG&amp;A			   4,523,809		     1,188,499</p>
<p> Income from operations   9,262,489			 449,940</p>
<p> Net income		   5,832,540			 595,452</p>
<p> Earnings per share		0.31			 0.04(a)</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>  of shares outstanding  18,840,850		    15,778,844</p>
<p>				     Fiscal Six Months Ended May 31,</p>
<p>					1997			    1996</p>
<p> Net revenues	     $97,383,546		   $29,784,256</p>
<p> Gross profit		27,329,318		     4,979,030</p>
<p> SG&amp;A			   9,302,951		     3,261,873</p>
<p> Income from operations  18,026,367		     1,717,157</p>
<p> Net income		  11,267,937		     4,897,641</p>
<p> Earnings per share		0.60			 0.31(a)</p>
<p>Weighted average number   of shares outstanding  18,878,940		    15,778,884</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Earnings per share for 1996 include a tax effect loss of $(0.01) for the second quarter and a gain of $0.11 per share for the six-month period related to the termination of its S corporation tax status resulting from its initial public offering.</p>
<p>Full name is Quintel Entertainment Inc.</p>
</text>
